<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PAG half year earnings surge.</title>
<headline>PAG half year earnings surge.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     10.7	  vs 4.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.41	  vs 1.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.48	  vs 1.75</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.57	  vs 0.62</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.81	  vs 0.07 paid</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  0.51	  vs  -</p>
<p>    Turnover		  66.95	 vs 40.88</p>
<p>Full name: PAG Ltd (professional recrutiment)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was in a healthy trading position and was poised for further expansion, with year earnings expected to be ahead of the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
